<title>ITALY: SOCCER-SAMPDORIA SIGN QPR'S DICHIO.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SAMPDORIA SIGN QPR'S DICHIO.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo-Italian Daniele Dichio, currently with English first division club Queens Park Rangers, will play for Serie A side Sampdoria next season, Italian media reported on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dichio, 22, born of an Italian father and English mother, is out of contract at the end of the season and thus will cost Sampdoria nothing.</p>
<p>A former England under 21 player, Dichio has signed a three-year contract with Sampdoria, the reports said.</p>
